      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 ESP32-S3 + SX1278 (Continuous RX)\n\u2022 Power: 2.5W Solar + 18650 Li-Ion\n\u2022 Anti-Loop Blacklist (5m TTL)\n\u2022 Self-Echo Filter (rep_id != 1)\n\u2022 Listen-Before-Talk (LBT / CAD)\n\u2022 Jitter Backoff (400 - 1200ms)",
